<title>UK: Airtours director off to Yates Wine.</title>
<headline>Airtours director off to Yates Wine.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>George Marcall, group sales and marketing director of leisure group Airtours Plc, is to resign from the company and move to a full-time executive director's position at Yates Brothers Wine Lodges plc.</p>
<p>Marcall will resign as a director of Airtours from December 11, the company said in a statement on Thursday. He is currently a non-executive director at Yates.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
